n new combat techniques, and discover a variety of spells and blessings. Thoroughness is crucial for your success.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/b622d5a273a8b015a4641b147f03799f.webp?t=1725414239\" width=621 height=61 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/af6a8f020bbcef57fc27ed2ad1db8db1.poster.avif?t=1725414239\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/af6a8f020bbcef57fc27ed2ad1db8db1.webm?t=1725414239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/af6a8f020bbcef57fc27ed2ad1db8db1.mp4?t=1725414239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Combine the physical might of a sword in melee combat with the powerful impact of defensive and offensive spells to challenge any enemy you encounter. Strategize, take control of the battlefield, and deliver decisive blows on the journey toward the light.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/47d885edc6a331bfcf86d480e6e58c45.webp?t=1725414239\" width=621 height=61 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/14c3b269413059512b0d1c9b8678a458.poster.avif?t=1725414239\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/14c3b269413059512b0d1c9b8678a458.webm?t=1725414239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/14c3b26941305